{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201120","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620112001:1":{"text":"こんにちは！最近、この辺りで変な人を見かけませんでしたか？","source_cn":"你好！请问你最近有没有见过什么奇怪的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41EE795E5CD0977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620112002:1":{"text":"例えば、夜な夜な墓地に忍び込んで、棺桶の上を跳ね回ったりする人です。","source_cn":"比如，经常在夜晚闯进来，然后在坟墓上蹦来蹦去之类的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8086B9C5025DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620112003:1":{"text":"見てないね。","source_cn":"没有。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC5DEFD0EB694FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620112004:1":{"text":"もう少しよく考えてみてよ……だいたい一カ月前から現れてるみたいなんだ。","source_cn":"怎么会呢？您再好好回忆一下……大概就是一个月前开始的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEA86BDFA80DB926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620112005:1":{"text":"俺はここに来て半年以上になるが、そんな不届き者はいなかったと断言してもいい。","source_cn":"我已经在这里呆了大半年了。我很确定，最近没有人在晚上闯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398D1C9DA9B46E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620112006:1":{"text":"ではこの一カ月、墓地で奇妙な出来事などはありませんでしたか？","source_cn":"那最近一个月，墓园里就没有什么其他的怪事发生吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B64CDCFD380BBD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620112007:1":{"text":"強いて言えば……夜になるとよく<style=\"highlight\">ネコの鳴き声</style>がして、何度も起こされたことかな。","source_cn":"硬要说的话……最近晚上总是有<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x288932E750D1BF87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620112008:1":{"text":"ネコの鳴き声……もしかしてアルチカさんの墓前で騒いでたのって、いたずら好きのネコだったのでは？","source_cn":"猫叫……难道在教授坟墓上作乱的，其实是调皮的猫吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EB92F6404B05C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620112009:1":{"text":"ロンロンはそうは思わないね。もし本当にネコだったら、アルチカさんが一度も見てないなんてあり得ないよ。","source_cn":"满满觉得不是。如果真的只是猫的话，教授怎么可能一次都没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD7372A89D755E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620112010:1":{"text":"それなら僕も証言できる！アルチカさんはものすごい速さで、棺桶から飛び出してきたんだ。ネコに逃げられるはずがない！","source_cn":"我作证！她出现速度那么快，唰得一下就从棺材里冒出来，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68143E4404A2ECD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620112011:1":{"text":"さっきから何を言ってるんだ？誰が棺桶から飛び出すって？","source_cn":"你们说什么，谁从棺材里冒出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2BF7248B8A1BC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620112012:1":{"text":"いや……それは……そうそう、棺桶の後ろの草むらだ！いやぁ、大事なところを省いちゃって……！","source_cn":"呃……那个……刚刚我说错了，教授其实是从棺材后的草丛里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0F23C8BB524186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1620112013:1":{"text":"誤魔化すのも下手なんですね……","source_cn":"听起来更可疑了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607518736182AB2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1620112014:1":{"text":"ああ……あんたら、幽霊を見たんだな。","source_cn":"哦，你们看到的是幽灵啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE25A145EAA3560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1620112014":{"text":"ああ……あんたら、幽霊を見たんだな。","source_cn":"哦，你们看到的是幽灵啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE25A145EAA3560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1620112015:1":{"text":"ここにいれば月に一度や二度、幽霊くらい見るん